# Shamrock Bail Bonds

> Licensed Florida bail bond agency. Owner: Brendan O'Neal. Serving families from 1528 Broadway, Fort Myers since 2012. Serves all 67 Florida counties.

## Contact
- Office: 1528 Broadway, Fort Myers, FL 33901
- Hours: Office walk-in hours Mon–Fri 9–5 · Phones answered 24/7
- Phone (main): 239-332-2245
- Spanish line: 727-295-2245
- Text: 239-955-0178

## Pricing (Florida-regulated)
- Premium is 10% of the bond, $100 minimum per charge.
- Federal bonds are 15%.
- Collateral and any fees are explained before you sign.

